hi im van ive been worldbuilding this universe for a year now. it took me a TON of research and hard work like haha you have no fucking idea man

this is.really quite something. so now that i've posted it after a YEAR of work i've decided to do what any responsible adult would and go to bed

special thanks to:

-everyone i interviewed about their experiences with trauma and sexual assault

-everyone who helped me not have a mental breakdown.my great bitches, my fine dudes

-DrClef, who saw my terrible first draft of this on ao3 literally a year ago (please dont look it up its Not Good) and encouraged me to keep going with it. this isbased off of his universe and headcanons. obviously i took some liberties and threw some shit out the window, but yeah man

offer my services elsewhere as well. not even close to being as visceral, but it deals more with the explicit reverberations of this that i felt were better suited to offsite tastes.

edit 10/18/2018:  lads i have no idea how i thought i could do another chapter of this and i also have no idea where i was going with this.like i was obsessing over this way more then i thought i was when i was writing it, and look. some people love this thing and think its one of the best things on the wiki. some people think its literally unreadable, and that it's laughably bad. to me, this was a wild year-long experiment, and it taught me a lot and i'm free. i don't consider this the best thing ive ever written, though it's definitely the longest so far, and i'm working towards writing things of this length that are 100% more coherent and effective then this piece (original stuff that will hopefully be published on other platforms).

so to those who love this:  great! i'm glad.

to those who hate this:  this is not the best thing I've ever written and was purely a big experiment in pushing myself in terms of my writing, and i appreciate you reading regardless. I'm still young and growing as a writer, and I'll have better, more coherent stories in the future.

overall, i'll probably not be expanding on this anymore (on this platform, at least) . between my feelings about it looking back at it a couple months later, addressing and working through some mental stuff that i was dealing with when i wrote it, and a various assortment of harassment i've received on other platforms about the visceral content of it, it's probably better if i leave it be for a while, or forever, or maybe rewrite/edit it when i'm older and better at writing.

that's not to say i won't write other pieces on the wiki, obviously. to my own jargon and to the dismay of many people displeased with seeing senior researcher content in general, i am ever determined by my unending crusade towards expanding the genre of angsty, artistic, dark ass character pieces, as well as working on some non-scp projects of my own, and i have to reassert that not everything i write will be like this .

thanks for reading!

